"<strong>Setups in the demo:</strong> Masses on a plate; Exploding firework; Walking on a boat.",
"<strong>Masses on a plate:</strong> up to four masses on a {#} m × {#} m plate. Drag a mass to move it (or select it with the keys {#} to {#} and move it with the arrow keys in {#} m steps), add or remove masses, and set the selected mass. The readouts give each mass and its position, the total mass and the center of mass.",
"<strong>Exploding firework:</strong> a firework launched at {#} m/s and {#}° splits into two pieces at the top of its flight. Set the front piece’s share of the mass, the speed the explosion gives the pieces apart and the direction the front piece is thrown. Launch pauses and resumes the flight; Reset goes back to the launch. The readouts give the time, the center of mass of the pieces, where the unexploded firework would be, and where each piece lands.",
