"Record reading stores the current setup’s readouts, including the mass share \\(f\\): the share of the total mass in mass {#} (plate, with two masses), in the front piece (firework) or in the person (boat). Export to worksheet sends the readings to the Data table below; Clear starts a new series, which goes into a new copy of the table.",
